WEBVTT

00:00:09.112 --> 00:00:11.512
Oh! Whoa, whoa! Oh!

00:00:14.552 --> 00:00:16.632
-(SCREAMS)
-TOGETHER: Buzz!

00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:19.192
-Buzz!
-(TOYS CHATTERING)

00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:21.112
SLINKY: I don't see him
in the driveway.

00:00:21.232 --> 00:00:24.832
-I think he bounced into Sid's yard!
-Oh! Buzz!

00:00:25.192 --> 00:00:27.152
(HORN HONKING)

00:00:27.192 --> 00:00:31.152
Hey, everyone, R.C.'s trying to
say something. What is it, boy?

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:34.992
-He's saying that this was no accident.
-What do you mean?

00:00:35.032 --> 00:00:37.472
-I mean Humpty-Dumpty was pushed...
-No!

00:00:37.512 --> 00:00:38.792
...by Woody!

00:00:38.832 --> 00:00:40.632
-ALL: What?
-Wait a minute.

00:00:40.752 --> 00:00:45.072
You don't think I meant to knock Buzz
out the window, do you? Potato Head?

00:00:45.152 --> 00:00:47.832
That's Mr. Potato Head to you,
you back-stabbing murderer!

00:00:47.912 --> 00:00:50.312
-(GASPS)
-Now, it was an accident, guys.

00:00:50.392 --> 00:00:53.272
Come on.
Now, you, you gotta believe me.

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:56.792
We believe ya, Woody.
Right, Rex?

00:00:56.832 --> 00:00:59.392
Well, ye... N...
I don't like confrontations!

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:03.112
Where is your honor, dirt bag?
You are an absolute disgrace!

00:01:03.192 --> 00:01:04.832
You don't deserve to... Hey!

00:01:04.912 --> 00:01:08.232
You couldn't handle Buzz cutting
in on your playtime, could you, Woody?

00:01:08.312 --> 00:01:12.392
Didn't wanna face the fact that Buzz
just might be Andy's new favorite toy.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:13.792
So you got rid of him.

00:01:13.832 --> 00:01:16.552
Well, what if Andy starts playing
with me more, Woody, huh?

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:18.592
You gonna knock me
outta the window too?

00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:20.832
I don't think we should
give him the chance.

00:01:20.952 --> 00:01:22.912
SERGEANT: There he is, men.
Frag him!

00:01:22.992 --> 00:01:24.472
Let's string him up
by his pull string!

00:01:24.512 --> 00:01:26.952
HAMM: I got dibs on his hat!
BO: Would you boys stop it!

00:01:27.032 --> 00:01:28.072
Tackle him!

00:01:28.152 --> 00:01:30.792
No, no, no! Wait!
I can explain everything!

00:01:30.872 --> 00:01:33.752
ANDY: Okay, Mom, be right down.
I've gotta get Buzz.

00:01:33.832 --> 00:01:34.952
SERGEANT: Retreat!

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:41.832
Mom, do you know
where Buzz is?

00:01:41.872 --> 00:01:43.392
-MOM: No, I haven't seen him.
-Psst!

00:01:45.952 --> 00:01:49.472
-MOM: Andy, I'm heading out the door!
-But, Mom, I can't find him!

00:01:49.552 --> 00:01:52.032
Honey, just grab some other toy.
Now, come on!

00:01:52.232 --> 00:01:54.072
Oh, okay.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:02.552
I couldn't find my Buzz.
I know I left him right there.

00:02:02.592 --> 00:02:05.592
Honey, I'm sure he's around.
You'll find him.

00:02:09.752 --> 00:02:12.072
(IGNITION STARTS)

00:02:14.752 --> 00:02:17.512
(CHITTERING)

00:02:19.592 --> 00:02:22.352
It's too short!
We need more monkeys!

00:02:22.432 --> 00:02:25.512
There aren't any more!
That's the whole barrel!

00:02:26.832 --> 00:02:28.872
Buzz, the monkeys
aren't working!

00:02:28.912 --> 00:02:32.912
We're formulating another plan!
Stay calm!

00:02:33.032 --> 00:02:34.952
Oh, where could he be?

00:02:44.272 --> 00:02:46.112
(SERVICE BELL DINGS)

00:02:46.632 --> 00:02:49.832
-Can I help pump the gas?
-Sure! I'll even let you drive.

00:02:49.912 --> 00:02:51.792
-Yeah?
-Yeah, when you're 16.

00:02:51.872 --> 00:02:53.912
-Yuk, yuk, yuk! Funny, Mom.
-(LAUGHING)

00:02:53.952 --> 00:02:58.392
Aw, great. How am I gonna convince
those guys it was an accident?

00:03:02.232 --> 00:03:04.032
Buzz!

00:03:05.632 --> 00:03:08.392
Buzz! Ha! You're alive!

00:03:08.472 --> 00:03:11.752
This is great!
Oh, I'm saved! I'm saved.

00:03:11.792 --> 00:03:14.352
Andy'll find you here,
he'll take us back to the room

00:03:14.432 --> 00:03:19.632
and then you can tell everyone
that this was all just a big mistake.

00:03:19.712 --> 00:03:22.472
Huh? Right?
(PANTING) Buddy?

00:03:22.512 --> 00:03:25.992
I just want you to know that even
though you tried to terminate me,

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:28.952
revenge is not an idea
we promote on my planet.

00:03:28.992 --> 00:03:33.032
-Oh. Well, that's good.
-But we're not on my planet, are we?

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:35.072
-No. (SCREAMING)
-(BUZZ GRUNTING)

00:03:35.152 --> 00:03:38.952
(BUZZ GRUNTING,
SPACESUIT BUZZING, BEEPING)

00:03:38.992 --> 00:03:40.672
(SCREAMING, GROANS)

00:03:40.752 --> 00:03:42.752
Okay, come on!

00:03:43.272 --> 00:03:44.992
WOODY: You want a piece of me?

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:47.952
(YELLS)

00:03:48.272 --> 00:03:50.272
(SQUEAKING)

00:03:50.352 --> 00:03:51.752
Owww!

00:03:51.832 --> 00:03:54.112
VOICE BOX: Buzz, Buzz,
Buzz Lightyear to the rescue.

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:55.432
-Aah-ouch!
-MOM: Next stop.

00:03:55.512 --> 00:03:57.032
Pizza Planet! Yeah!

00:03:57.112 --> 00:03:58.512
(DOOR SLIDES SHUT,
IGNITION STARTS)

00:03:58.552 --> 00:04:01.032
-(DOOR SHUTS)
-(GASPS) Andy!

